WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.720
Master, it's me, Yeom

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.930
Yesterday was a hundred days since you meditated

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.310
It's time to go outside

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.100
Master

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:21.940
Master

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.740
Master...

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:28.780
Master

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:31.870
Master!

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:33.790
Master...

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.580
Master!

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.550
- Poor boy
- Poor thing

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.100
- Holy Heavens
- Incredible

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.810
- He must have frozen to death
- It seems so

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:53.640
- I feel so sorry for him
- Poor baby

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:54.940
- It's a pity
- How so?

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.690
What's going on here? What is this?

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:58.940
Homeless boy died

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.610
He was just a child. I feel so sorry for him

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.740
How can this be?

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:29.090
Just like you always wanted

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.350
I will quietly say goodbye to you, master

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:42.980
I feel so sorry for him

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.740
He seems to be an orphan

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:47.320
Shall we hold a funeral for him?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.570
- Yes
- Let's

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.700
Maybe cremate...

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.950
and scatter the ashes over Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake?

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.950
Boy...

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.000
are you okay?

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Alina

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.500
- Well...
- How...

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.630
-Where is he going?
-Where are you going?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.350
Stand!

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:25.780
Child

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.200
Did you just tell me to stop?

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.450
What a fool!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.620
I can't believe you already burned my body

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.160
What are you talking about?

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.590
If I had come a little later, you would have burned my cane too.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.260
Fool!

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.140
Fool!

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.430
Fool!

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:57.520
Fool!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.940
M-master?

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.490
I just left my body for a while

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.360
to check if I have reached Hwangsu

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.820
after one hundred days of meditation

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:17.200
But I noticed that my body was burning, so I quickly moved into another

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.500
But it's too late

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.840
So are you in this boy's body?

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.130
Is it really you, master?

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:29.550
Exactly

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.630
I am Lee Chul, your master

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.050
Here we go...

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.560
Master

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:39.810
Master

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.950
I'm a nomad

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:04.290
Your Majesty

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:08.630
Didn't you call me to find the nomad?

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.510
That's exactly what I'll do

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.380
I can

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.380
recognize nomads

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.880
Has anyone else seen your face?

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.340
This is an umbrella

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.930
Can be used as a cane

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:02.680
No

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:06.020
In the capital no one else knows that I am sighted

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.230
People will think that bandits fought here

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.740
You should have stopped looking for me

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.580
So I

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.420
So Yi, is that you?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.050
I am Kim from Sari village

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.550
You made a mistake

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:45.980
We barely know each other. He hardly knows me

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.100
About that man

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:49.150
need to take care

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.870
There was no need to kill him

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.500
If he had gone to Sari, we would never have met again

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:06.660
But you met

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.670
Sari Village?

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.880
Is that where you stayed?

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.180
I was hiding there

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.390
Hiding from these thugs

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.680
Is there anyone left there who might recognize you?

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:31.730
I didn’t get close to anyone so that they wouldn’t recognize me

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.480
I was a thief there

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.230
- What is this?
- Money

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:39.490
It will be suspicious if the money doesn't disappear

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.160
Keep it for yourself

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.260
I didn't mean to harm anyone from Sari Village

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.520
Moo Dok in the capital

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:15.980
If we meet, will we have to kill her?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.200
Trader Kim from Sari Village is here?

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:23.780
Yes, he just arrived

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.910
He's in the last room on the second floor

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:57.980
Madam?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.700
What brought you to this place?

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.250
It's none of your business. You haven't seen me here

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.830
Madam, are you really playing?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.500
into gambling?

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.460
What? Gambling?

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:24.090
Who do you take me for? Am I some kind of simpleton, in your opinion?

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:25.720
No, of course

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.510
But you lied to me when you said the jade wasn't broken

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.520
Considering your ability to lie without a twinge of conscience,

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.190
I thought maybe you have a talent for gambling too

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.240
I came to the seller for tickets

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.320
Tickets for the show were sold out

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.740
That's why I came here

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:48.780
Entrance ticket
Magi Seochon

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:52.500
- You have two tickets
- I'm going with my mom

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.330
Don't tell anyone you saw me here

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.790
I don't want any misunderstanding

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.170
How to know

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.800
You see, I'm not as good at lying as you are.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.420
If someone asks, I'm not sure I could lie

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.640
But for your sake I will try

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.140
I was lucky enough to meet her here

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.990
Why is the head of Sosnovy Bor here?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:36.290
I hope he's not here for the tickets.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.250
Then I won't be able to go to the show with Dong Gu.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.500
It's you

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.170
killed him

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.220
It's not me

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.510
Why did you kill him?

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:32.970
It's really not me

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.020
He was already dead when I arrived

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.520
He was killed not long ago

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:43.360
He was killed with one blow

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:45.940
Master Swordsman

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.070
I swear it wasn't me

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:51.870
I don't even have a sword

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.800
I think one person killed them

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.390
Who are these men?

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:22.440
These are thugs who arrived in the capital recently

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.520
They have arrived

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:28.570
with trader Kim from the village of Sari?

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:29.950
No

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:34.570
But I remember those thugs picking a fight with him a couple of days ago

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:40.960
They wanted to know where the fraudster who lived in Sari was located.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.620
Sari scammer?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.500
Maybe it's Moo Deok?

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.760
Where is she?

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.140
He was here

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:58.970
She ran away

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:10.820
What's going on?

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.410
What were these bodies?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:18.830
They wanted to know where the fraudster who lived in Sari was located.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.160
Could they have meant me?

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:25.330
What kind of life did Moo Deok live?

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.550
Have you met So Yi?

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.800
I wonder what she did this time

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.670
Don't mess with her

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:35.890
So Yi...

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.100
Who is So Yi?

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.140
I haven't seen her myself

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.940
But she quarreled with all the guards, and even slapped one in the face

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:49.940
I'm sure they remembered her face

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:54.030
Madam, not a single guard came today

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.160
- They both didn’t come?
- Yes

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.740
Strange. They never miss work

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.250
We're sorry. We shouldn't have treated the magician like that

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.380
But is this really necessary?

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.880
"Magu"?

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.380
Did you lie about being a magician?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.090
I'll be him soon

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:20.680
And even more powerful than you

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:26.480
How dare a fake talk to me like that?

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:28.980
I'll talk down to you

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.780
and you will treat me with respect. Isn't it?

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.240
Run after him

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.740
It's your job

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:53.090
There is a girl in Jwiseonru named Moo Deok from Sari Village?

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:56.510
Yes, I know her. Were you looking for her that night?

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.640
I wanted to ask her for a favor and return something.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.760
Moo Deok is not in Jwiseonru

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:06.020
She is a maid in the Jang family, which is Gwangju Jeonbugwan's family.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:08.060
Is she a maid?

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.310
Looks like she really can see now

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.280
She probably fooled you too

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.030
They brought her to Chwisonra, they thought she was blind,

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:18.530
But everyone was surprised when she opened her eyes and ran away

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.120
But she's not a fraud like me

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:24.740
How can she see?

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:30.250
Please don't kill me

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:32.380
I'm sorry

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.170
You saw my face, I can't leave you alive

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.590
Please...

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:05.290
If she could see then she could recognize me

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:09.580
Is she a maid of the Chang family?

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.920
I have to visit her

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.300
Did Moo Deok commit murder?

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:21.050
Several men were killed in the inn

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:23.800
Moo Deok was there

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:27.640
But Moo Deok is not strong enough to kill anyone

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.600
Especially a few men

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.900
This was done by a skilled swordsman

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:33.900
If it's not her

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.610
a magician must have helped her

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.280
Just don't say

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.950
that you suspect our master

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.320
No

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:47.870
Wook is now in the palace with Master Li

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.370
Thank heavens

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.880
It couldn't be Moo Deok

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:56.210
She has no reason to kill

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.460
Maid Kim,

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:00.920
How well do you know Moo Deok?

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:03.800
You know

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:09.020
What kind of life did she lead before she started working here?

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:11.940
What?

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.730
Killed -

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.440
the man I asked about Moo Deok's past

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.110
Bandits who may have been looking for her

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:22.610
dead too

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.240
Obviously she would come under suspicion

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.870
but she ran away instead of proving her innocence

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:32.500
What am I sure of -

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:37.210
Moo Deok is hiding something

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:40.710
what cannot be disclosed

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.270
The guards live over there

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.190
It would be faster

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:58.440
draw her portrait and look for her yourself

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.110
I don't know what she looks like

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:03.030
- I met her when I was still blind
- I thought you weren't

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:08.320
Now you say that you were blind, then you say that you were not

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.450
I don’t know what’s going on there, but your life is clearly not easy

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:18.000
So you don’t know her by sight, but she knows you?

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.170
Maybe it’s even dangerous to look for her?

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.970
What if it was she who killed those people?

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:25.550
And suddenly it will harm you

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.720
It's more dangerous to be a suspected leader

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.230
You can get hurt too, but you paid the merchant

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:36.560
That is?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.730
I don't understand what you mean

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:41.570
Exactly

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:44.740
Pretend you don't know anything

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.320
Someone died!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.010
Guard Li and Guard Chan!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:20.560
Hwangsu will give you incredible strength

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:24.860
I thought all nomads were monsters

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.570
But you have gained youth and immortality

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:31.160
It's clear now

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.870
why did everyone want ice stone for alchemy?

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:37.410
Everyone was so thirsty for him, they were always fighting

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.290
Therefore this magic is forbidden

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:40.750
Okay, Master Li

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.590
You can recognize them

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:45.090
Look around

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.510
Are there any nomads in the palace?

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:05.190
Just looking at a person is not enough

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:07.440
If the blue mark is not visible

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.450
or signs of wildness,

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.610
they are indistinguishable from ordinary people

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:15.330
Then how do you recognize them?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.200
Fear of being caught

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.460
Fear of petrification

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.460
We need to get this fear out

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.840
So you instill fear in them?

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.720
Sorry if I disappointed you

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.350
In return

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.810
I'll give you a gift

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.940
Gift? What's there?

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:43.350
Dog

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.310
Dog?

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.070
He is very smart and obedient

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.360
He is now standing at the gates of the palace

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.490
Can I bring him?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.700
Since it's a gift, then of course

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:56.660
Bring the dog

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.450
Chan Wook

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.830
I want you to bring him

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:06.340
If you can handle it, I'll reward you

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:39.080
Should I just run away with Moo Deok?

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.710
Then everyone will understand

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:47.170
And now I am weak and will not protect my teacher

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.220
I wonder what Master Li is going to do?

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:24.210
Deputy

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.620
What is it?

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:34.670
Is this fluffy a gift from the master to the king?

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:38.470
Master Li said the dog will follow you

00:22:39.050 --> 00:22:40.640
But be careful

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:44.730
What is the danger of taking him into the palace?

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:46.480
What's the matter?

00:22:48.020 --> 00:22:48.980
This is Gwigu

00:22:49.770 --> 00:22:51.320
He brought Gwiga to the palace

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:53.940
But Gwigu is a monster

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:56.700
How could he bring him to the palace?

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:02.200
My teacher Seo Kyung used Gwiga

00:23:02.290 --> 00:23:05.040
to search for relics created by dark magic

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:07.870
using an ice stone

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:09.670
Yes I heard

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:12.710
But I thought it could no longer be used,

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:14.710
because his urn is broken

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:15.760
Therefore

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:20.850
I transferred Gwigu's soul into the body of a dead dog

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:24.680
The dog I brought

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:26.980
this is Gwigu

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:30.940
Gwiga?

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:36.570
What should we do?

00:23:38.110 --> 00:23:39.950
How many of us are there in the palace?

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:41.700
More than ten

00:23:42.280 --> 00:23:43.660
Transferred to Jeonbugwan?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:46.620
Sent a man, they will arrive soon

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:16.820
This meeting is organized in order to establish peace between the magicians and the palace

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:20.820
The Crown Prince visited Sosnovy Bor, and honored you by inviting you here

00:24:20.910 --> 00:24:22.450
Do you want to bring it here?

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:24.700
monster without asking His Majesty's permission?

00:24:24.780 --> 00:24:26.790
He gave his permission

00:24:26.870 --> 00:24:28.660
And now Gwigu

00:24:28.750 --> 00:24:31.460
not a monster, because in the body of an ordinary dog

00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:34.670
So, he won’t be able to harm the nomad even if he finds him?

00:24:34.750 --> 00:24:38.260
He will start barking, so we will understand

00:24:39.550 --> 00:24:40.590
Woof

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:42.800
Woof!

00:25:00.570 --> 00:25:01.990
This is a nomad

00:25:02.860 --> 00:25:05.950
As we thought, nomads in the palace

00:25:12.460 --> 00:25:13.580
What's that sound?

00:25:14.330 --> 00:25:17.550
So there are nomads in my palace?

00:25:19.340 --> 00:25:20.380
Looks like it

00:25:21.090 --> 00:25:23.590
Then why are you just standing here?

00:25:23.680 --> 00:25:26.430
Go and catch him!

00:25:26.510 --> 00:25:29.390
Like I said, the dog is a gift.

00:25:29.470 --> 00:25:32.350
I'll leave it here

00:25:32.440 --> 00:25:34.650
With its help you will find everyone

00:25:34.730 --> 00:25:36.360
nomads in the palace

00:25:37.190 --> 00:25:38.980
Take him away, we don't need him

00:25:39.610 --> 00:25:42.190
How dare you bring this monster here?!

00:25:42.280 --> 00:25:43.900
The king suffers from anxiety

00:25:43.990 --> 00:25:46.870
Are you trying to harm him with this monster?

00:25:49.240 --> 00:25:52.870
Mother, we ourselves invited Master Li to the palace

00:25:52.960 --> 00:25:54.670
Don't get involved in this

00:25:55.540 --> 00:25:59.130
It is Jeonbugwan's duty to protect the palace.

00:25:59.210 --> 00:26:01.460
If dark magic was used in the palace,

00:26:01.550 --> 00:26:03.380
they'll figure it out

00:26:03.470 --> 00:26:06.010
I don't want to see a monster in a dog's body,

00:26:06.090 --> 00:26:07.890
neither the people of Sosnovy Bor

00:26:08.430 --> 00:26:11.310
You're trying to humiliate us

00:26:13.350 --> 00:26:15.230
Stop them, Your Majesty

00:26:43.090 --> 00:26:45.670
Gwangju Jeonbugwan's son must protect the palace,

00:26:45.760 --> 00:26:47.720
and you brought this monster here

00:26:49.600 --> 00:26:51.680
This is Master Li's gift to the king

00:26:51.760 --> 00:26:53.310
Let us in

00:26:53.390 --> 00:26:55.730
I was ordered to bring him

00:27:01.360 --> 00:27:02.360
How's that?

00:27:02.440 --> 00:27:04.360
Then try to come in

00:27:04.940 --> 00:27:06.820
Kill this beast that has entered the palace

00:27:09.320 --> 00:27:12.280
If you can handle it, I'll reward you

00:27:12.870 --> 00:27:15.620
Is that why he asked me to bring the dog?

00:27:44.070 --> 00:27:45.690
Your Majesty, this is Jin Mu

00:27:46.280 --> 00:27:48.900
I'll get rid of these insolent people from Sosnovy Bor

00:27:49.450 --> 00:27:52.450
We are here at his invitation, and we haven’t finished talking

00:27:52.530 --> 00:27:54.580
Jin Moo, you shouldn't get involved in this.

00:27:54.660 --> 00:27:56.950
How dare you bring this monster here without permission?!

00:27:57.040 --> 00:27:58.660
What kind of behavior is this?!

00:27:58.750 --> 00:27:59.960
Be silent

00:28:16.390 --> 00:28:18.680
Guards! Don't stand there! Stop him!

00:28:23.270 --> 00:28:24.400
Father

00:28:24.480 --> 00:28:26.070
Stop them both

00:28:26.150 --> 00:28:28.400
If a fight starts, our relationship will end

00:28:28.990 --> 00:28:29.950
We must fight!

00:28:30.030 --> 00:28:32.950
The pine forest brought this beast here!

00:28:33.030 --> 00:28:34.620
Jeonbugwan must protect us

00:28:35.370 --> 00:28:37.200
- Father!
- Your Majesty

00:28:41.870 --> 00:28:42.960
I order everyone...

00:28:45.000 --> 00:28:46.090
stop

00:29:05.360 --> 00:29:06.650
Stop!

00:29:21.330 --> 00:29:22.580
Master Li,

00:29:22.670 --> 00:29:25.460
I invited you in a friendly manner, was it necessary to scare me like that?

00:29:26.130 --> 00:29:27.670
Sorry

00:29:28.630 --> 00:29:32.010
Your Majesty, if the ice stone is unsealed,

00:29:32.090 --> 00:29:34.550
bloodshed will begin again

00:29:35.140 --> 00:29:36.220
Ice stone?

00:29:36.300 --> 00:29:37.970
Is it because of the nomads?

00:29:38.060 --> 00:29:39.640
People used

00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:42.730
reflectors for the alchemy of souls after the Great Chaos

00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:47.400
Apparently someone is making reflectors again

00:29:49.320 --> 00:29:52.700
Ice stone printed

00:29:58.870 --> 00:29:59.910
And?

00:29:59.990 --> 00:30:02.160
Where is he? In whose hands?

00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:04.710
Perhaps it is with those

00:30:04.790 --> 00:30:08.290
who sent Nak Su and turned the magician of Sosnovy Bor into a nomad

00:30:08.880 --> 00:30:10.550
I heard Master Seo Kyung

00:30:10.630 --> 00:30:12.920
destroyed all the ice stones 200 years ago

00:30:13.010 --> 00:30:13.920
Apparently

00:30:14.010 --> 00:30:17.930
not all were destroyed, some remained in Sosnovy Bor

00:30:18.010 --> 00:30:21.560
It's not easy to curb human desires

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:22.680
But

00:30:24.020 --> 00:30:25.730
return of the ice stone

00:30:25.810 --> 00:30:29.060
marks the coming of a man like Master Seo Kyung

00:30:32.280 --> 00:30:35.320
Master So Kyung was born under the star of the King

00:30:35.900 --> 00:30:38.030
However, he did not become king

00:30:39.740 --> 00:30:41.120
Do you want to say

00:30:41.910 --> 00:30:44.370
Is there anyone else born under this star?

00:30:49.210 --> 00:30:51.630
Even if it exists, its light will be weak

00:30:51.710 --> 00:30:55.920
And the energy of the seven stars that surround him has not yet manifested itself

00:30:57.010 --> 00:30:59.220
A force that can withstand nature,

00:30:59.300 --> 00:31:03.180
and bring chaos to the world, awakened again

00:31:03.270 --> 00:31:05.350
There will be someone who will stop it

00:31:06.230 --> 00:31:07.310
Like this

00:31:08.600 --> 00:31:11.650
balance will be maintained in the world

00:31:17.650 --> 00:31:22.410
What I'm saying is there's no point in worrying

00:31:23.870 --> 00:31:27.460
I hope this brings you peace

00:31:32.710 --> 00:31:35.090
Thanks for your words

00:31:35.920 --> 00:31:38.510
Now I have to go

00:31:39.220 --> 00:31:41.550
You refused my gift

00:31:41.640 --> 00:31:44.350
so I'll take Gwiga with me

00:31:46.060 --> 00:31:48.060
- Your Majesty
- Do as you wish

00:32:07.410 --> 00:32:09.540
No, wait

00:32:10.370 --> 00:32:12.210
Are we leaving?

00:32:12.290 --> 00:32:13.840
I saw everything I wanted

00:32:16.300 --> 00:32:19.010
So there are nomads in my palace?

00:32:19.510 --> 00:32:21.140
Take him away, we don't need him

00:32:21.220 --> 00:32:23.800
How dare you bring this monster here?!

00:32:25.180 --> 00:32:26.930
They showed themselves when I gave them fear

00:32:30.600 --> 00:32:32.310
Scared?

00:32:32.400 --> 00:32:33.980
Not injured?

00:32:34.060 --> 00:32:35.860
How did you get hurt?

00:32:37.070 --> 00:32:40.030
The dog is fine, but I'm not, because of you

00:32:41.780 --> 00:32:42.820
Got hurt?

00:32:43.490 --> 00:32:45.990
I got hurt when I fought with those bandits, right?

00:32:46.080 --> 00:32:47.870
He's got a long way to go, right?

00:32:50.250 --> 00:32:52.040
Wait, that's blood. Hurt?

00:32:52.880 --> 00:32:54.040
This is my blood

00:32:54.130 --> 00:32:55.420
He wasn't hurt at all...

00:32:56.130 --> 00:32:58.170
- Blood...
- You're covered in it

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:00.760
Well that's good

00:33:06.180 --> 00:33:07.470
Does it hurt?

00:33:09.270 --> 00:33:10.430
Apparently yes

00:33:11.060 --> 00:33:13.400
It hurts...

00:33:22.950 --> 00:33:25.120
Gwigu belongs to Master Li

00:33:25.620 --> 00:33:28.540
How much does he know about Moo Deok?

00:33:29.540 --> 00:33:31.500
And what will Uk do?

00:33:31.580 --> 00:33:33.370
when will he find out about Nak Soo?

00:33:42.050 --> 00:33:43.090
Are you okay?

00:33:44.590 --> 00:33:45.720
All covered in cuts

00:33:45.800 --> 00:33:47.550
I'm fine

00:33:47.640 --> 00:33:50.350
Have you found the nomads? What about the stone?

00:33:51.520 --> 00:33:52.980
You can't imagine...

00:33:53.690 --> 00:33:56.020
My soul almost moved with horror

00:33:56.610 --> 00:33:59.110
They staged a scene, but found no one?

00:33:59.190 --> 00:34:02.610
Let the dog bite someone

00:34:03.240 --> 00:34:04.320
Uk

00:34:04.400 --> 00:34:06.570
Look for the nomad in the palace

00:34:06.660 --> 00:34:08.990
more difficult than in Sosnovy Bor or Jeonbugwan

00:34:10.200 --> 00:34:11.700
If things get out of hand,

00:34:11.790 --> 00:34:14.290
a conflict will arise between the palace and Sosnovy Bor

00:34:17.420 --> 00:34:18.380
Let's go

00:34:18.460 --> 00:34:19.800
You need patching up

00:34:20.500 --> 00:34:21.510
Master

00:34:25.050 --> 00:34:27.050
Wait a little

00:34:27.140 --> 00:34:30.220
The Crown Prince has asked to escort you to his palace.

00:34:30.810 --> 00:34:33.100
- Crown Prince?
- It's going to rain

00:34:33.180 --> 00:34:35.560
He wants you to wait for him

00:34:37.810 --> 00:34:38.900
Lead

00:34:47.740 --> 00:34:50.490
Uk, send it first

00:34:50.580 --> 00:34:52.080
to Sosnovy Bor

00:34:53.250 --> 00:34:54.410
Come here

00:34:55.830 --> 00:34:56.960
Here

00:35:09.180 --> 00:35:12.810
You should have told me that they were invited to the palace!

00:35:12.890 --> 00:35:14.060
I thought this would be

00:35:14.810 --> 00:35:16.520
regular meeting

00:35:17.020 --> 00:35:18.060
If the queen

00:35:18.150 --> 00:35:20.520
suffer, you will turn to stone like eunuch Kim

00:35:20.610 --> 00:35:22.320
Useless piece of meat!

00:35:34.450 --> 00:35:36.540
Someone born under the star of the King,

00:35:36.620 --> 00:35:38.920
what will repeat the fate of Master So Kyung?

00:35:41.250 --> 00:35:43.840
If it turns out that this star is the fruit of dark magic,

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:46.720
The end of the pine forest

00:35:50.680 --> 00:35:53.970
I sent Gviga to Sosnovy Bor

00:35:55.060 --> 00:35:57.100
Sorry for scaring you

00:35:57.180 --> 00:35:59.440
When the nomad was found in Sosnovy Bor,

00:35:59.520 --> 00:36:01.900
I thought that they might be in the palace too

00:36:02.940 --> 00:36:06.150
Recently he even tried to get here

00:36:06.900 --> 00:36:09.030
I heard that she created it

00:36:09.110 --> 00:36:10.860
and killed Nak Soo

00:36:15.290 --> 00:36:16.370
Nak Soo?

00:36:18.250 --> 00:36:21.080
Mercenary who killed many warriors

00:36:21.750 --> 00:36:23.590
Heads fly off the shoulders where she's been

00:36:23.670 --> 00:36:25.550
That's why she's called that

00:36:25.630 --> 00:36:29.220
There are rumors that she is a nomad and that she is alive

00:36:32.430 --> 00:36:34.050
Nomad Nak Su?

00:36:35.640 --> 00:36:37.390
Interesting rumors

00:37:11.630 --> 00:37:15.260
I hope Moo Deok gets caught before the master returns

00:37:22.520 --> 00:37:24.190
Moo Deok...

00:37:26.480 --> 00:37:27.860
Why are you shaking?

00:37:28.480 --> 00:37:30.820
Do you really believe that I killed someone?

00:37:32.820 --> 00:37:34.820
Come in

00:37:40.250 --> 00:37:41.710
Why did you come?

00:37:42.660 --> 00:37:44.000
Take things and run away?

00:37:44.080 --> 00:37:46.130
I came to ask for something

00:37:46.710 --> 00:37:48.920
The head said to catch you as soon as you appear

00:37:49.920 --> 00:37:51.090
Moo Deok,

00:37:51.170 --> 00:37:52.470
You didn't do this, did you?

00:37:53.180 --> 00:37:56.010
- Not me
-Then why did you run away?

00:37:56.680 --> 00:37:58.100
I had to

00:37:59.470 --> 00:38:00.770
Moo Deok

00:38:01.520 --> 00:38:02.600
You have

00:38:03.520 --> 00:38:05.400
any secrets?

00:38:10.900 --> 00:38:12.240
Young Master

00:38:13.320 --> 00:38:15.030
aware of them?

00:38:21.040 --> 00:38:24.620
Moo Deok, you should run away

00:38:25.210 --> 00:38:26.290
I'll give you money

00:38:26.370 --> 00:38:27.960
Run and don't come back

00:38:28.040 --> 00:38:29.170
I can't

00:38:30.380 --> 00:38:32.710
I can't leave my master

00:38:32.800 --> 00:38:34.050
Why?

00:38:35.300 --> 00:38:38.430
If you stay close, he will also fall under suspicion.

00:38:38.510 --> 00:38:39.850
If you're worried about him,

00:38:40.640 --> 00:38:42.100
then help me

00:38:42.180 --> 00:38:45.100
You don’t want to talk to the head, you don’t want to run away either

00:38:45.690 --> 00:38:47.020
What will you do?

00:38:48.690 --> 00:38:50.520
We need to find the killer

00:38:51.980 --> 00:38:56.360
The killer kills those who know him by sight

00:39:01.410 --> 00:39:03.450
Is this where Gwangju Jeonbugwan lives?

00:39:04.290 --> 00:39:06.160
Apparently an influential family

00:39:08.120 --> 00:39:11.420
Does anyone from the Chan family know you?

00:39:14.130 --> 00:39:17.340
Wait around the corner. I'll bring this man

00:39:28.140 --> 00:39:30.310
I want to ask someone to confirm

00:39:30.400 --> 00:39:33.980
that I was not in the room when those people were killed

00:39:35.360 --> 00:39:36.650
And who?

00:39:37.240 --> 00:39:38.610
Mrs. Jin from Jinyeowon

00:39:39.610 --> 00:39:41.200
I ran into her there

00:39:42.200 --> 00:39:44.370
This sissy will not agree to meet you

00:39:45.620 --> 00:39:46.830
Maid Kim

00:39:47.960 --> 00:39:50.210
Take me to Jinyeowon

00:39:52.420 --> 00:39:53.420
Jinyoewon?

00:40:18.030 --> 00:40:21.450
Excuse me, can you help me lift the crutch?

00:40:27.910 --> 00:40:28.870
Thank you

00:40:29.750 --> 00:40:32.290
Won't you tell me where I am?

00:40:33.040 --> 00:40:37.010
At Jeonbugwan's Gwangju House

00:40:38.800 --> 00:40:39.970
I see

00:40:41.010 --> 00:40:42.090
Thank you

00:40:55.360 --> 00:40:56.610
Moo Deok

00:40:56.690 --> 00:40:57.730
Let's go

00:41:05.530 --> 00:41:07.490
Apparently Moo Deok can see now

00:41:08.120 --> 00:41:10.080
But she didn't recognize me

00:41:10.870 --> 00:41:12.540
I hope it's for the better

00:41:16.170 --> 00:41:17.420
Why are you alone?

00:41:18.210 --> 00:41:21.130
I was wrong. We don't know her at all

00:41:22.550 --> 00:41:24.970
We're done. Let's return to Jeonbugwan

00:41:37.150 --> 00:41:38.690
Can I try it?

00:41:38.780 --> 00:41:39.650
- No
- No

00:41:39.730 --> 00:41:41.860
Stop it

00:41:41.950 --> 00:41:43.860
I'm wet

00:41:43.950 --> 00:41:45.570
This is that umbrella

00:41:46.200 --> 00:41:47.120
This is an umbrella

00:41:48.080 --> 00:41:49.950
Can be used as a cane

00:41:52.960 --> 00:41:55.500
Mom will scold me, stop it

00:41:55.580 --> 00:41:56.500
Enough is enough

00:41:57.170 --> 00:41:59.420
- No way
- Hey

00:42:00.710 --> 00:42:03.720
Would you like to trade umbrellas with me?

00:42:07.600 --> 00:42:11.890
I heard Nak Soo moved

00:42:11.980 --> 00:42:15.730
into the body of a tall, well-built young man

00:42:15.810 --> 00:42:19.320
She could move into the body of a small, weak woman

00:42:21.400 --> 00:42:26.030
With such a weak body, there would be no point in touching her.

00:42:28.910 --> 00:42:30.040
But no

00:42:30.580 --> 00:42:32.790
Nak Soo in blue was definitely a man

00:42:33.580 --> 00:42:35.000
"Nak Soo in Blue"

00:42:35.080 --> 00:42:38.460
- I heard about it
- He was dressed all in blue

00:42:38.540 --> 00:42:42.630
It spread everywhere, people started wearing blue

00:42:42.710 --> 00:42:45.090
They thought then

00:42:45.180 --> 00:42:48.220
Nak Su in blue will protect them from the alchemy of souls

00:42:49.930 --> 00:42:51.720
Nak Soo was a mercenary

00:42:53.220 --> 00:42:56.140
but she didn’t kill ordinary people, and she didn’t have the strength

00:43:01.780 --> 00:43:04.650
People can be so stupid

00:43:04.740 --> 00:43:06.320
This is not stupidity

00:43:07.200 --> 00:43:08.450
It's fear

00:43:11.200 --> 00:43:13.790
Nak Soo's body was burned, everyone knows it

00:43:14.660 --> 00:43:17.460
This is the work of the powerful and influential

00:43:19.250 --> 00:43:20.710
Call them fools

00:43:21.670 --> 00:43:23.840
when they're just scared, it's wrong

00:43:33.100 --> 00:43:36.730
I brought you together in hopes of finding a solution,

00:43:36.810 --> 00:43:40.020
but you have the nerve to sit here and criticize me

00:43:43.270 --> 00:43:46.990
I understand that you want to humiliate each other,

00:43:47.070 --> 00:43:50.240
but I hope we all start to get along

00:43:51.160 --> 00:43:53.410
Master Li is also with us

00:43:53.490 --> 00:43:54.660
Let's drink tea

00:43:57.750 --> 00:43:59.040
Your Highness

00:44:00.040 --> 00:44:01.380
What?

00:44:04.800 --> 00:44:07.550
Lady Huo requests an audience

00:44:07.630 --> 00:44:08.630
Let her in

00:44:17.140 --> 00:44:18.430
What is it?

00:44:18.520 --> 00:44:20.980
I heard someone got hurt after the fight

00:44:21.560 --> 00:44:23.190
Came to check

00:44:25.320 --> 00:44:27.610
Only one was injured here

00:44:27.690 --> 00:44:30.570
- Take him away and treat him
- I'm fine

00:44:30.660 --> 00:44:32.160
It won't be long

00:44:32.240 --> 00:44:33.450
Come with me

00:44:45.840 --> 00:44:48.510
Looks like Chan Wook will be engaged again

00:44:48.590 --> 00:44:49.630
For the umpteenth time already?

00:44:49.720 --> 00:44:51.720
- What does it mean?
- Don’t you know?

00:44:51.800 --> 00:44:54.010
Do you really know nothing?

00:44:54.100 --> 00:44:56.100
Rumors are circulating in Saejukwon

00:44:56.180 --> 00:44:59.890
You three are potential candidates to be Master Ho Yeom's son-in-law

00:45:00.480 --> 00:45:02.150
Uk is third on the list

00:45:02.230 --> 00:45:04.060
But for her, apparently, he is the first

00:45:05.020 --> 00:45:06.980
Ho Yeom wants to marry her off this year

00:45:07.070 --> 00:45:09.780
Soon there will be talk of engagement. I assure you

00:45:15.870 --> 00:45:19.790
The wounds are not deep. These pills will stop the bleeding

00:45:19.870 --> 00:45:22.710
You should have given them to me right away

00:45:22.790 --> 00:45:24.630
I heard about the wounds

00:45:24.710 --> 00:45:29.090
I wanted to check it myself to calm down

00:45:31.800 --> 00:45:32.880
Well...

00:45:33.550 --> 00:45:37.890
You have been wounded more than once, so this thought arose...

00:45:39.020 --> 00:45:40.270
I'm fine

00:45:40.980 --> 00:45:42.230
Okay

00:45:48.440 --> 00:45:52.530
Oh, exactly. Maid Kim gave it to me

00:45:52.610 --> 00:45:55.240
I haven't thanked her yet

00:45:57.030 --> 00:45:58.330
She's the same

00:46:03.620 --> 00:46:04.620
Is it the same?

00:46:06.630 --> 00:46:08.960
A hairpin that I saw twenty years ago

00:46:09.590 --> 00:46:11.630
Oh, is this something valuable?

00:46:16.340 --> 00:46:17.800
Looks new

00:46:17.890 --> 00:46:19.890
Probably not ours

00:46:20.680 --> 00:46:22.520
But it's done so similar

00:46:23.850 --> 00:46:24.690
That's it

00:46:25.350 --> 00:46:27.310
Apparently the prince was right

00:46:28.440 --> 00:46:30.610
We'll hear about Wook's engagement soon

00:46:30.690 --> 00:46:32.650
But for Master Huo he is third on the list

00:46:34.990 --> 00:46:37.320
Will you marry her yourself, since you are the first on this list?

00:46:38.370 --> 00:46:41.410
If you get married, you'll have to return to Seho

00:46:42.000 --> 00:46:45.000
Yulia, just don’t get married. I'll be lonely

00:46:46.620 --> 00:46:48.920
I can recognize nomads

00:46:57.510 --> 00:47:00.050
We need to take it with us to Seho as soon as possible

00:47:00.140 --> 00:47:01.180
Who?

00:47:02.060 --> 00:47:02.930
Me?

00:47:09.110 --> 00:47:10.440
I take my words back

00:47:11.150 --> 00:47:15.740
I felt better after seeing your reaction today.

00:47:16.320 --> 00:47:17.950
Glad to hear that

00:47:18.870 --> 00:47:20.910
What did you want to ask me personally?

00:47:23.080 --> 00:47:25.660
I know that you have the Nak Soo sword

00:47:25.750 --> 00:47:27.750
Can I pick it up?

00:47:36.420 --> 00:47:39.640
I saw the show last year

00:47:40.220 --> 00:47:41.470
There were elephants there too

00:47:41.970 --> 00:47:45.180
But when I go with Dan Gu, I have to pretend that it’s my first time there

00:47:45.270 --> 00:47:47.810
So those tickets were for you and Mr. Dan Gu?

00:47:47.890 --> 00:47:50.060
Scared me. What are you doing here?

00:47:50.150 --> 00:47:52.690
I came to ask for a favor

00:47:52.770 --> 00:47:53.900
About the service?

00:47:54.940 --> 00:47:56.320
Don't bother

00:47:56.400 --> 00:47:59.490
I have no desire to help you

00:47:59.570 --> 00:48:01.200
I'm accused of murder

00:48:01.950 --> 00:48:03.080
What?

00:48:03.160 --> 00:48:05.410
You can go to the head of Sosnovy Bor

00:48:06.120 --> 00:48:08.540
and say you saw me?

00:48:09.670 --> 00:48:13.920
Do you want me to go to the head and admit that I went

00:48:14.500 --> 00:48:15.760
to such a place?

00:48:16.460 --> 00:48:18.300
I'm not crazy

00:48:20.180 --> 00:48:21.800
You are my only hope

00:48:22.470 --> 00:48:24.350
Please

00:48:27.430 --> 00:48:28.600
No

00:48:28.680 --> 00:48:30.600
I told Dan Gu that I have an extra ticket.

00:48:30.690 --> 00:48:32.560
I don't want him to know where I bought them.

00:48:32.650 --> 00:48:35.270
Your shame will be temporary

00:48:35.360 --> 00:48:37.360
and they might kill me

00:48:38.360 --> 00:48:40.400
If mom finds out, I won't live either.

00:48:40.490 --> 00:48:43.240
She would never kill her daughter!

00:48:43.320 --> 00:48:45.540
Why are you shouting when you came to ask for help?

00:48:48.290 --> 00:48:51.580
Then I'll have to tell your mother everything myself.

00:48:52.080 --> 00:48:53.710
and ask her for help

00:48:53.790 --> 00:48:55.420
Should I ask my mom?

00:48:56.840 --> 00:48:58.380
And here she is

00:49:00.760 --> 00:49:03.800
You shouldn't have bothered with gifts to apologize for the past.

00:49:05.100 --> 00:49:08.770
The more I think about it, the more I want to apologize

00:49:10.180 --> 00:49:12.730
I'll go and ask her myself

00:49:12.810 --> 00:49:13.730
Wait a minute

00:49:13.810 --> 00:49:16.900
I'll think about it. First come with me

00:49:25.740 --> 00:49:27.790
I'll be right back. Wait here

00:49:28.370 --> 00:49:29.830
If you don't come back, I'll scream

00:49:29.910 --> 00:49:31.410
- I'll be back
- Cho Young

00:49:32.210 --> 00:49:33.330
Yes, mother

00:49:34.130 --> 00:49:34.960
Wait

00:50:06.280 --> 00:50:07.660
Very young

00:50:08.990 --> 00:50:10.160
I wonder who it is?

00:50:39.610 --> 00:50:41.230
Is it because of the incense?

00:50:45.240 --> 00:50:46.530
Beautiful vase

00:50:47.570 --> 00:50:51.540
If you put flowers in this vase, they will smell stronger

00:50:52.790 --> 00:50:54.710
- Really?
- Yes

00:50:54.790 --> 00:50:58.000
I have long wanted to change the vase in my daughter’s room

00:50:59.040 --> 00:50:59.960
Thank you

00:51:03.670 --> 00:51:06.720
Mother, will you put a vase in Boo Young unnie's room?

00:51:06.800 --> 00:51:08.720
Flowers will smell stronger

00:51:08.800 --> 00:51:12.470
Your sister is blind, so at least she can enjoy the smell of flowers

00:51:56.770 --> 00:51:58.100
How dare you?!

00:51:58.190 --> 00:52:00.020
What are you doing in my daughter's room?

00:52:04.900 --> 00:52:06.320
She came with me

00:52:06.400 --> 00:52:07.860
Probably lost

00:52:08.450 --> 00:52:10.700
Moo Deok, what are you doing here?

00:52:12.990 --> 00:52:14.160
Sorry

00:52:15.950 --> 00:52:18.120
Help me just once

00:52:19.460 --> 00:52:21.040
Go away

00:52:21.130 --> 00:52:22.960
And don't come back anymore

00:52:23.040 --> 00:52:24.750
Yes

00:52:28.340 --> 00:52:30.180
I'll come. I promise

00:52:32.640 --> 00:52:33.720
Cho Young,

00:52:34.390 --> 00:52:37.980
tell the servants to clean your sister's room again

00:52:38.730 --> 00:52:40.520
Yes, mother

00:53:08.260 --> 00:53:09.260
So I

00:53:10.260 --> 00:53:12.050
This man will be your father

00:53:13.010 --> 00:53:14.140
Father?

00:53:15.050 --> 00:53:17.470
Does a father want to bring a fake daughter into the house?

00:53:20.850 --> 00:53:24.480
I am not Jin Bu Young's father by blood

00:53:25.980 --> 00:53:29.030
Her real father is someone else

00:53:41.660 --> 00:53:44.380
To be recognized as the daughter of the Jin family,

00:53:44.460 --> 00:53:46.340
you must open the doors of Jinyoung

00:53:46.420 --> 00:53:49.840
And for this, their blood must flow through your veins

00:53:53.720 --> 00:53:55.050
What is this?

00:53:55.140 --> 00:53:58.470
A worm containing the blood of a Jin family member

00:54:20.450 --> 00:54:22.370
This is Cho Young's blood

00:54:23.370 --> 00:54:24.920
my favorite

00:54:26.790 --> 00:54:28.960
And what will you do about it?

00:54:29.040 --> 00:54:30.460
Reach out your hand

00:54:32.630 --> 00:54:34.220
Don't keep me waiting

00:55:17.680 --> 00:55:20.850
Now you have the blood of the Jin family.

00:55:21.930 --> 00:55:24.350
If I didn't use dark magic,

00:55:24.430 --> 00:55:27.310
this worm will eat you from the inside

00:55:28.650 --> 00:55:30.230
Trying to escape

00:55:31.070 --> 00:55:33.360
this worm will eat you alive

00:55:40.450 --> 00:55:43.120
This is the room of her daughter, who died 10 years ago.

00:55:44.290 --> 00:55:45.870
Apparently she drowned

00:55:46.620 --> 00:55:49.170
but Mrs. Jin still thinks she will come back

00:55:50.750 --> 00:55:51.960
I feel sorry for her

00:55:52.920 --> 00:55:54.590
Forgive her for the slap

00:55:57.720 --> 00:56:00.760
Was her daughter blind?

00:56:01.680 --> 00:56:03.970
Yes, I was

00:56:05.270 --> 00:56:07.480
The owner of this body was also blind

00:56:08.270 --> 00:56:10.600
Maybe that's why I felt something strange?

00:56:28.080 --> 00:56:31.210
Master Li wanted to talk to the prince alone about something.

00:56:31.830 --> 00:56:32.840
I see

00:56:38.010 --> 00:56:40.970
The head asked to accompany you to Sosnovy Bor

00:56:41.550 --> 00:56:43.550
Me? Why?

00:56:43.640 --> 00:56:44.640
Come with us

00:56:55.150 --> 00:56:56.730
They'll lock me up here again, right?

00:56:57.230 --> 00:56:59.070
- What's happening?
- This...

00:56:59.780 --> 00:57:01.110
We are told to be silent

00:57:01.910 --> 00:57:03.120
Wait for him here

00:57:12.830 --> 00:57:16.090
Moo Deok was seen next to the bodies, it's clear why she was taken away

00:57:16.170 --> 00:57:18.670
But why, sir? He was in the palace

00:57:20.050 --> 00:57:22.590
What is the boss thinking?

00:57:22.680 --> 00:57:23.680
I don't know

00:57:26.310 --> 00:57:27.350
Yul,

00:57:27.430 --> 00:57:29.560
Moo Deok won't kill anyone

00:57:30.180 --> 00:57:31.270
Really?

00:57:34.360 --> 00:57:36.520
Can I look at the bodies?

00:57:49.410 --> 00:57:51.290
The killer wielded the sword skillfully

00:57:51.910 --> 00:57:53.540
This can't be Moo Deok

00:57:55.170 --> 00:57:56.750
But she's Nak Soo

00:57:57.710 --> 00:57:59.460
She could have killed them

00:58:04.640 --> 00:58:07.550
I have my reasons

00:58:07.640 --> 00:58:09.060
don't get in my way

00:58:12.640 --> 00:58:15.480
- These are those bandits
- Do you know them?

00:58:17.770 --> 00:58:20.030
I fought them not too long ago

00:58:25.280 --> 00:58:27.830
Can I take their bodies and have a funeral?

00:58:34.370 --> 00:58:36.500
What brought Chief Chwiseonra here?

00:58:36.580 --> 00:58:38.090
Did someone die?

00:58:38.170 --> 00:58:40.630
Our guards were killed

00:58:53.930 --> 00:58:55.310
Dan Gu

00:58:55.390 --> 00:58:57.310
Maid Kim spoke about what happened

00:58:59.230 --> 00:59:00.610
Cho Young,

00:59:01.610 --> 00:59:03.240
help Moo Deok

00:59:11.120 --> 00:59:13.870
I went there to buy tickets

00:59:15.710 --> 00:59:17.580
Moo Deok was there

00:59:19.670 --> 00:59:20.710
Of course

00:59:20.790 --> 00:59:24.590
It was my first time in such a place

00:59:25.170 --> 00:59:26.260
I know

00:59:27.090 --> 00:59:30.850
We talked for a while and then Moo Deok came in

00:59:30.930 --> 00:59:32.890
I saw you too as you entered

00:59:33.810 --> 00:59:38.270
Of course I didn't think I'd see you in a place like this

00:59:39.940 --> 00:59:41.110
I know

00:59:44.570 --> 00:59:45.990
Here's what happens...

00:59:47.030 --> 00:59:51.120
Moo Deok would never have had the time to kill those men.

00:59:52.160 --> 00:59:55.370
Recently a girl came to Jwiseonru looking for Moo Deok

00:59:55.450 --> 00:59:56.910
She pretended to be a magician

00:59:57.000 --> 00:59:58.500
Chief Chwisungru thinks

00:59:58.580 --> 01:00:02.540
this could be So Yi, the girl the merchant warned Moo Deok about

01:00:02.630 --> 01:00:05.010
I once saw a girl being dragged by these bandits

01:00:06.340 --> 01:00:07.590
Merchant,

01:00:07.670 --> 01:00:08.970
bandits and guards

01:00:09.840 --> 01:00:12.100
They all crossed paths with this So Yi

01:00:12.180 --> 01:00:14.010
This scammer So Yi is very suspicious

01:00:14.890 --> 01:00:17.140
This means Moo Deok is not to blame.

01:00:18.690 --> 01:00:19.730
Okay

01:00:20.730 --> 01:00:25.320
I myself doubted that Moo Deok could kill anyone

01:00:25.400 --> 01:00:29.530
That's it. You knew, uncle, that Moo Deok was not capable of this, right?

01:00:29.610 --> 01:00:33.160
Can you let Wook and Moo Deok go now?

01:00:33.240 --> 01:00:35.490
I locked them up to

01:00:36.370 --> 01:00:38.330
ask something

01:00:39.370 --> 01:00:40.870
I'll take care of the rest myself

01:00:40.960 --> 01:00:42.080
You can go

01:00:42.170 --> 01:00:43.340
Okay

01:01:02.270 --> 01:01:03.520
Chapter

01:01:04.270 --> 01:01:06.900
At least tell me what's wrong

01:01:07.690 --> 01:01:10.150
Moo Deok committed murder

01:01:13.280 --> 01:01:14.280
What...

01:01:14.370 --> 01:01:17.450
She killed those who knew her in the past

01:01:20.620 --> 01:01:24.670
Tell me what you and Moo Deok are hiding

01:01:25.840 --> 01:01:28.300
If your words don't match Moo Deok's,

01:01:28.880 --> 01:01:31.220
you won't leave this room

01:01:32.050 --> 01:01:33.800
And Moo Deok will die

01:01:55.120 --> 01:01:56.660
Chief, listen...

01:01:56.740 --> 01:01:58.080
It's not about murder

01:02:00.040 --> 01:02:02.000
Uk revealed your secret to me

01:02:03.290 --> 01:02:04.540
He told everything

01:02:08.130 --> 01:02:12.050
If you also tell the truth, I will spare your life

01:02:13.180 --> 01:02:14.340
But if

01:02:14.430 --> 01:02:17.510
your words will differ

01:02:19.430 --> 01:02:20.890
you will die

01:02:29.820 --> 01:02:31.690
If he knew that she was a nomad,

01:02:31.780 --> 01:02:33.740
I wouldn't waste my time like this

01:02:33.820 --> 01:02:36.410
He's trying to split us by interrogating us separately

01:02:37.240 --> 01:02:39.580
We must say the same thing

01:02:41.370 --> 01:02:44.620
What would Chan Wook answer?

01:02:44.710 --> 01:02:48.540
A secret that we both are guaranteed to reveal

01:02:48.630 --> 01:02:53.220
A secret whose disclosure will not lead to my death

01:02:56.300 --> 01:02:57.760
I'll tell you

01:02:57.840 --> 01:02:59.220
I confess to you

01:03:06.900 --> 01:03:08.360
What happened?

01:03:09.360 --> 01:03:11.320
Moo Deok and Chan Wook

01:03:12.190 --> 01:03:13.320
you can let go

01:03:13.820 --> 01:03:16.860
What did they say? One and the same?

01:03:20.080 --> 01:03:23.080
They said... the same thing

01:03:52.570 --> 01:03:55.440
- You came out
- You too

01:03:56.030 --> 01:03:58.910
- Glad you're okay
- Me too

01:03:58.990 --> 01:04:00.820
Thankfully we said the same thing

01:04:02.370 --> 01:04:03.870
What did you say?

01:04:03.950 --> 01:04:05.660
We both left...

01:04:07.040 --> 01:04:09.040
so you said the same thing

01:04:14.000 --> 01:04:17.470
You locked them up to find out what they were hiding

01:04:17.550 --> 01:04:19.470
I think you've figured out something

01:04:19.550 --> 01:04:20.390
Tell me

01:04:20.470 --> 01:04:22.850
What's their secret there?

01:04:23.760 --> 01:04:25.180
They...

01:04:26.270 --> 01:04:29.730
literally left me speechless

01:04:32.560 --> 01:04:35.190
They showed the same thing

01:04:37.110 --> 01:04:38.490
I'll tell the truth

01:04:39.400 --> 01:04:41.030
I tried not to get caught

01:04:42.280 --> 01:04:44.080
This is what I was hiding

01:05:01.720 --> 01:05:03.220
You see, I...

01:05:03.720 --> 01:05:06.100
Actually I...

01:05:13.060 --> 01:05:14.690
love Moo Deok

01:05:18.530 --> 01:05:20.360
I love the owner very much

01:05:26.740 --> 01:05:29.200
I thought you'd probably admit it

01:05:31.040 --> 01:05:33.420
They wouldn't kill me for this

01:05:33.500 --> 01:05:37.250
Yes, and in the Sosnovy Bor rule book there is nothing about this

01:05:37.340 --> 01:05:39.710
There is no prohibition for a boy to love a girl

01:05:42.880 --> 01:05:43.720
Yes

01:05:43.800 --> 01:05:47.850
And a servant's love for her master will not lead to death

01:05:49.930 --> 01:05:53.230
Is that what you said? Why do you love me to death?

01:05:54.980 --> 01:05:56.110
Well...

01:05:56.820 --> 01:06:00.030
I exaggerated so that he would believe

01:06:03.280 --> 01:06:04.820
There was no other choice

01:06:06.200 --> 01:06:09.700
There was no choice but to admit that you love me to death

01:06:10.910 --> 01:06:12.620
I'm kind of sorry

01:06:13.330 --> 01:06:15.710
I didn't put so much feeling into my confession.

01:06:16.250 --> 01:06:17.540
I had to try

01:06:17.630 --> 01:06:18.800
Forget it

01:06:20.590 --> 01:06:24.590
Don't put everything on the line for something as fickle as love.

01:06:25.930 --> 01:06:27.850
If this happens again,

01:06:28.600 --> 01:06:30.890
and life will depend on the choice,

01:06:31.980 --> 01:06:33.230
betray love

01:06:34.520 --> 01:06:35.730
and choose life

01:06:38.110 --> 01:06:39.730
Unless, of course, you want to die

01:06:40.650 --> 01:06:42.190
This is the teacher's order

01:06:47.240 --> 01:06:48.370
teacher,

01:06:49.080 --> 01:06:50.620
what if I don't mind dying?

01:06:51.410 --> 01:06:53.830
Can I then continue to love you?

01:06:56.290 --> 01:06:58.420
In other words, I'm willing to risk it all

01:06:59.380 --> 01:07:01.170
so that we can be together

01:07:02.550 --> 01:07:04.170
I'll do so

01:07:04.720 --> 01:07:09.180
Do the same, stick to your confession

01:07:10.720 --> 01:07:12.310
Love me to death

01:07:23.470 --> 01:07:40.840
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:07:48.840 --> 01:07:51.760
Alchemy

01:07:48.840 --> 01:07:51.760
Shower

01:07:51.810 --> 01:07:55.730
If Uk falls in love with someone he shouldn't,

01:07:55.810 --> 01:07:57.230
what will you do?

01:07:57.310 --> 01:08:01.270
If I'm with you, I need to make sure that you're mine

01:08:01.360 --> 01:08:03.230
How dare you disgrace Jinyeowon?

01:08:03.980 --> 01:08:05.030
- Salty
- Two boots - a pair

01:08:05.110 --> 01:08:06.400
Why didn't you get married?

01:08:06.490 --> 01:08:08.240
I'm looking for shaman Choi

01:08:08.320 --> 01:08:11.160
If the shaman was hunted by the magicians of Jeonbugwan...

01:08:11.240 --> 01:08:14.080
Are you looking for her because she holds a grudge against your father?

01:08:14.160 --> 01:08:16.870
If he comes, report immediately

01:08:16.960 --> 01:08:18.540
Even dead, it's Gwigu

01:08:18.620 --> 01:08:20.500
You pretend you don't know, right?

01:08:21.170 --> 01:08:23.750
It was hard for you, right?

01:08:23.840 --> 01:08:26.170
If you have to draw a sword and point it at someone,

01:08:26.260 --> 01:08:28.550
let me be the first
